# Turns the collected conformance columns into docs/support-table.md. Run from the repository root,
# after `sh test/lib/conformance.sh`.
#
#   haxe test/lib/table.hxml
#
# Exits non-zero when a column disagrees with its target's interpreter, or when a case with a
# written answer produced a different one.
-cp test/lib
-main Table
--interp
